@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Tamu" as Tamu
boundary "Landing Page" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Profiles" as DB

== Akses Landing Page ==

Tamu -> UI : Akses URL Landing Page
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/public/packages
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data paket & harga
activate DB
DB --> System : Daftar paket aktif
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data paket layanan
deactivate System
activate UI
UI -> UI : Render halaman\n(Hero, Paket, Testimoni)
UI --> Tamu : Tampilkan informasi\npaket & harga layanan
deactivate UI

== Registrasi dari Landing Page ==

Tamu -> UI : Klik tombol Daftar\npada paket yang dipilih
activate UI
UI --> Tamu : Tampilkan form registrasi
deactivate UI

Tamu -> UI : Isi form\n(Nama, Alamat, No. WhatsApp)
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/public/register
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi kelengkapan\n& format data
alt Data Tidak Valid / Duplikat
    System --> UI : Error validasi
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Tamu : Tampilkan error,\nminta isi ulang
    deactivate UI
else Data Valid
    System -> DB : INSERT registrations\n(status = pending)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : registration_id
    deactivate DB

    System -> System : Kirim notifikasi WA ke Admin
    System --> UI : Registrasi berhasil
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Tamu : Registrasi diterima,\nmenunggu review Admin
    deactivate UI
end

note right of Tamu
  Landing page menampilkan
  paket internet yang tersedia.
  Tamu dapat mendaftar langsung.
  Status awal: pending.
end note

@enduml
